<title>HONG KONG: Whimsy interim profit plunges 56.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Whimsy interim profit plunges 56.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   2.61   vs 6.06</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0    vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    5.49   vs 12.73</p>
<p>    Turnover		     141.16 vs 117.85 (see note)</p>
<p>    Company name		 Whimsy Entertainment Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 20-24</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   February 21</p>
<p>NOTE -  Whimsy Entertainment operates amusement centres.</p>
<p>Turnover in the previous period restated to include revenue derived from the franchise operation.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
